<view class="container">
  <view class="card welcome-card">
    <view class="emoji">🐾</view>
    <view class="title">欢迎上任，新典狱长</view>
    <view class="subtitle">这里由你说了算——前提是别让囚犯饿着。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="subtitle">你的日常就是这一套循环：</view>
    <view class="loop-row">
      <view class="loop-step">🍲 喂食</view>
      <view class="loop-arrow">→</view>
      <view class="loop-step">🏃 放风</view>
      <view class="loop-arrow">→</view>
      <view class="loop-step">🎮 陪玩</view>
    </view>
    <view class="loop-flow guide">照顾 → 好感 → 经营评分 → 外显等级</view>
    <view class="hint">把囚犯伺候好了，你的评分才好看。别指望一只饿着肚子的仓鼠替你上班。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn btn--guide" bindtap="gotoBind">开始看管</view>
  <view class="hint" bindtap="gotoLogin">重新登录 / 切换账号</view>
</view>
